WEBVTT

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.850
I never figured you for a baseball fan.

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:41.520
Any snipers positioned in the stadium would be easily visible.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.890
I see...

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:44.980
Let's hear it.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:49.940
The target is the special ambassador from Jordan, Bail Mahada.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:55.990
He intends to submit our CIA activities in the Middle East to the UN as war crimes.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:58.240
The State Department put him up to it.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:03.790
They're trying to knock us out of the picture to increase their yearly budget.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:06.330
We won't let that happen.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.250
The pay is 3 million dollars.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.460
The condition is this: do it inside the airport.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:13.420
Inside the airport?

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:13.970
Why?

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:18.470
Outside the airport the security responsibility falls to us.

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:23.470
It's a difficult situation, but only you can do it.

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:28.020
Will you do it for us, Golgo 13?

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:50.250
I held my breath and kept waiting while my heart was scratched away

00:01:52.090 --> 00:02:01.600
A minute, a second never felt so long

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:13.360
I look up at the sky and ask the wind, "Can I fly now?"

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:19.660
The weak person I was is no more

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:25.240
I decided to just believe

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:32.380
With the dreams I once had in my hand now

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:36.210
I go towards you

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:43.930
Carrying those emotions I felt when I broke

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:48.060
I go towards you

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:52.110
Blown by the wind

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:57.570
Oh blown

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:03.950
Dead Angle

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:13.880
Cold, ain't it?

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:14.880
Yeah.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.820
Throw your gum out.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:08.530
The undersecretary doesn't like gum.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:09.160
Ok.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.130
The Katz Doble.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:22.630
He's young.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.550
B-But undersecretary...

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.970
His skills and accomplishments are certain.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:30.680
He set the world record for competitive rifle shooting at age 19,

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:34.230
and if he'd gone to the Olympics he would have won a gold for sure...

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:36.140
He's going to be facing more than just a target!

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.230
Golgo 13, right?

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:39.230
W-What-

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.730
H-How did you know?

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:45.820
I can look at the secret intelligence databases of the world's nations at will.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:50.990
The client is the DoD and the CIA.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:54.910
The target is the special envoy from Jordan, Bail Mahada.

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:59.500
The date is June 1st, three days from now, at 15:00.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:03.500
The place, JFK International in New York.

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:10.760
Mahada will move by foot from his special chartered flight to a helicopter waiting at the VIP heliport.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:13.760
At most, he'll spend one minute moving.

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:18.270
He's going to hit the target there.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.850
I-I get it.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:23.110
It's true that the target is Golgo 13.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:26.280
But you can't just knock him off anywhere.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:29.910
You want me to aim for the moment when he goes after Mahada, right?

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:31.660
How did you-

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:38.870
When I kill him, if he's for some reason unarmed, it'd be a huge error on the part of the State Department.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:46.880
So you need the circumstantial evidence of him having a gun and aiming for Special Envoy Mahada.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.840
That's right.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:52.140
But we don't know where he'll aim.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:53.350
Sure we do.

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.430
It's simple.

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:55.510
Simple?

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:08.820
H-How did you know my password?

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:13.320
Don't worry about it. I know the President's password too.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:24.710
After Mahada arrives from his charter flight, he'll walk to the heliport.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:32.760
These are the four buildings he could pick, but this one, the closest, is too close to the target.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:36.510
Even if he was successful he would be found immediately.

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:42.020
And I can't imagine a sniper of his caliber striking from a location like that.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.900
Next, this building.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.070
This building has no roof, and no windows.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:50.150
It's impossible to strike from here.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:54.910
Which leaves us the cargo center building and the control tower building.

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:58.410
Which one of these buildings will he choose?

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:05.000
He always has two potential places,
a main one, and a second one just in case.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:08.000
So it will be these two places-

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:11.010
I'll show you something interesting.

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:34.740
From here, you can aim for Mahada head on when he's coming from his charter flight to the helicopter.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:38.450
It's the perfect place to hit a moving target.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:42.120
And there are a lot of places to hide.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.340
What?

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:54.930
T-This is-

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:56.470
Interesting, huh?

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:58.470
Golgo 13's rifle?

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:07.810
On June 1st, when envoy Mahada arrives, security is going to be several times tighter than normal.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:10.980
Even Golgo 13 would have a hard time bringing a gun in.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:15.990
So he splits his gun into parts and sends it in ahead of time.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:19.990
If I was on this job, I'd do the same thing.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:23.500
So where's the other place?

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:29.420
The observation equipment room directly below the control tower, a.k.a. the GMC room.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.510
Told you it was simple, didn't I?

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:42.220
And from this window in the GMC room you can also look over the heliport.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:50.560
Even if this is just an equipment room, there's a lot of people coming in and out of the control tower.

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:54.440
Won't he choose the cargo center building?

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:57.450
I don't know about that.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:07.710
From this point, no matter which area Golgo 13 arrives at, I can take him out for sure.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:11.420
And this is outside his range.

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:17.840
Even in the event that he notices me,
all he could do is wait for me to kill him.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:24.520
What if he showed up above that hangar?

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.690
He'd see you easily.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:31.900
There's a 100% chance he won't show up there.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:34.940
The world of information has no 100%.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:37.190
It does.

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:43.120
It's true that he could see me from the top of that hangar.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:49.210
But from that position, the control room would block his view of the target.

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:50.880
I see.

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:56.210
In other words, those two sniper locations are the only ones possible.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:11:01.220
Now, bring it Golgo 13!

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:17.230
To the airport.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.830
How's our security looking, Mr. Smith?

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:19.670
Oh my, the Secretary of Defense and the chief of the CIA themselves...

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.220
It's a pleasure to see you.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:25.550
We're taking care of the security perfectly, there's no need to worry.

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:31.930
You're guarding the special envoy of the Jordanese government, who was called directly by the State Department.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:34.600
Let us see how you do.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.690
Golgo 13 has appeared.

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:43.860
Golgo 13...

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:47.070
Send that image to all of our men!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:08.930
Excuse me, can we see what you're carrying?

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:11.680
Security is especially tight today...

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.890
We'll ask for your cooperation.

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:22.570
What is this?

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:25.200
One of my client's children gave it to me.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:31.080
Sorry to bother you.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.330
Safe travels.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:46.220
Golgo 13 is not carrying any weapons.

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:48.340
We will start following him.

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:02.440
I can't imagine that it's a coincidence Golgo 13 appeared here today.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:06.570
We can assume he's here to assassinate special envoy Mahada.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:09.700
One of the fanatics who oppose their government must have sent him.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:13.620
Mr. Smith, envoy Mahada will be alright, yes?

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.160
Don't take your eyes off Golgo 13.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:18.830
Don't lose him, no matter what.

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:21.750
Those bastards actually did it.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:29.340
We need to stop the assassination of Mahada no matter what, and kill Golgo 13 right in front of them!

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:31.470
Is the SWAT team in position?

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.850
I don't want that brat to be doing it alone!

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:35.850
Yes, they've been dispatched.

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:39.350
They're deployed to assist Katz.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:40.440
OK.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:44.150
But they're not going to screw up and shoot Katz, are they?

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:46.400
We don't need to worry about that.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:53.160
I've given him a Director's Order and a Special Order, and ordered the SWAT not to act until he's fired.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.290
Katz, can you hear me?

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.210
Golgo 13 has appeared.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.160
We're following him now.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:03.420
In 25 minutes special envoy Mahada's plane will arrive.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:05.090
Are you ready?

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.420
Roger.

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:09.680
I've been ready for a half hour.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.050
Cargo center building.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:14.680
GMC Room.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:16.930
I'm ready whenever.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.680
Come, Golgo 13.

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:28.690
Golgo 13 is heading for the cargo center building.

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:30.490
He still doesn't have any weapons.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:38.330
Excuse me.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:39.580
I have to go to the bathroom.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:43.710
Has he moved?

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:47.380
He's headed for the cargo center building.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.880
The charter flight will arrive shortly.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:52.930
Looks like the GMC room was the sub.

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:55.350
His movements are a feint.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:58.350
The main is the GMC room.

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:00.980
It's here.

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:06.940
Golgo 13...

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:10.440
Your legend will end soon!

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:22.460
The plane is almost here.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.040
Emergency!

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.580
We've lost Golgo 13!

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.830
Inside the cargo center building!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.330
What about the security monitors?

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.710
What is this?

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:13.340
I don't know why, but the area of the explosion is blocked off by smoke and you can't see anything!

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:14.510
Find him!

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:16.010
He's still in there somewhere-

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:19.350
No, send someone to the control tower!

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:21.520
Find him no matter what!

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:37.200
You lost him in the cargo center building?

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.450
Don't worry.

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:41.370
He's heading for the GMC room.

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:44.040
Don't waste your time, Golgo 13.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.960
I know what you're up to.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.310
I-It's Golgo 13.

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.520
I found him going inside the hangar!

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:06.600
The hangar?

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:14.570
What's wrong, Golgo?

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:16.070
Just one more minute!

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:20.240
What?

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.410
He went in the hangar?

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:23.290
What kind of weapons does he have?

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:24.490
He's unarmed.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:26.750
He must have hidden them in the hangar somewhere!

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.370
That's impossible.

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:31.130
He can't aim for Mahada from the hangar!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.960
But he's there!

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.880
If he appears, stop him no matter what.

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:45.310
Golgo 13 is in the hangar!

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:46.770
Back up Katz!

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.360
What's wrong, Golgo 13?

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.400
Mahada is getting into the helicopter.

00:18:56.860 --> 00:19:00.280
And why are you going in the hangar?

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.910
What's going on, Golgo 13?

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:09.250
I-Is he aiming for me?

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:11.710
I-Is he aiming for me?

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:12.540
Bring it!

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:26.180
It's 800 meters to the hangar.

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:32.730
He's here!

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.200
Okay, I made it in time.

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:44.240
Come, Golgo 13!

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:00.510
Katz!

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:44.050
Too bad, Mr. Smith.

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:49.140
I guess Golgo 13 is the man who makes the impossible possible after all.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:51.520
We'll be going now.

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:01.690
So 100% was impossible after all?

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:04.700
W-What will we do about Golgo 13?

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:07.280
Our plan failed.

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:10.120
Leave the rest to airport security.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:11.910
We're leaving.

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:23.920
I guess I lose.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:31.970
He aimed for the instant it passed the gap between the control tower and the cargo center building

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:35.390
To aim for such a small area...

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:35.980
I-I lose completely.

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:39.480
I-I lose completely.

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:54.540
This thing's great at hitting targets, but its useless in an unexpected close quarters fight against an M-16.

00:21:57.370 --> 00:22:00.500
I'll know for next time...

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:04.170
I guess I won't, huh?

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:49.680
Chiisana koto ni zenryoku ni naru kimi no sugata yuuki ni natta hibi

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:49.680
Those days I saw you giving your all for small things filled me with courage

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:57.140
Zutto horyuu shippanashi jya ugokenai

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:57.140
If I keep them suspended then I won't be able to move

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:06.690
GARASU no HAIWEI ni tatteiru you ni

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:06.690
It's like I'm standing on a glass highway

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.910
Yume to kiken to senaka awase demo

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.910
Even if I'm standing back to back with dreams and danger

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:21.040
Kono nagai michi wo sukoshizutsu arukou

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:21.040
I'll take this long road one step at a time

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:27.210
Soshite kimi wa ano koro mitai ni

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:27.210
And I need you to smile

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:30.220
Waratteite

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:30.220
Like you did back then

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:36.850
Shiokaze ni yurete sasayakiatta

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:36.850
It shook in the sea breeze and whispered

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:47.440
Kagayaiteita tooi ano hi wa kagerou

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:47.440
That distant and shining day is a shimmering haze

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:49.320
The shining days

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:55.280
Tsumaranai koto ni makeru ni wa hayasugiru

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:55.280
I can't lose to something so trivial

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:05.880
A star football player is assassinated during the middle of a game.

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:09.010
An old detective is at the scene.

00:24:09.840 --> 00:24:15.640
He separates from the high-tech investigation, and goes after Golgo 13 on his own.

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:21.520
Will his sharpened intution be enough to catch Golgo?

00:24:21.520 --> 00:24:23.400
Next time on Golgo 13:

00:24:23.400 --> 00:24:24.770
TOUCH DOWN

00:24:25.190 --> 00:24:28.780
Don't stand behind him if you value your life.
